 "definitions": {
  "b_expr5": "mean over genetic source tables holding k (own line out; tables with control CPM) of the count of the table's DE genes (|LFC/SE| > 3, the table's own > 5 CPM gate, own gene out) gated (> 5 CPM) in the target line's controls",
